{"v":3,"catch":"面對未知，以勇氣戰鬥，並揭開隱藏的秘密。","desc":"進入一個充滿神秘、危險和挑戰的世界——只有最勇敢的人才能堅持到最後。這款動作冒險遊戲將激烈的戰鬥與精妙的探索技巧相結合，為玩家帶來沉浸式的體驗。\n\n主要特色：\n• 動態戰鬥：揮舞劍進行近戰攻擊，或用弓箭遠距離精準瞄準。每一次戰鬥都需要策略和快速反應。\n• 捕捉彈道：捕捉敵人的箭矢和火球，並將其轉化為優勢－化守為攻。\n• 探索與獎勵：發現隱藏在地圖各處的寶箱、資源與重要線索。\n• 線索與謎題：每個關卡都包含巧妙的提示和智力謎題。關注細節是進步的關鍵。\n\n每一步都會讓你更接近黑暗的秘密。你準備好證明自己的勇氣，解開謎團，成為傳奇人物了嗎？冒險現在開始！","publisher":"Global Games Publisher","release":"2025-10-16","genres":["動作","格鬥","模擬","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 4.9GB / Switch 4.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b176734b4c90f5a0b3cf5a490cedf8461b78bc132b3d2b453e39d26e2dc04f47.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/326e4a57588e717e291f8633e2b65735efa5d8b35a1bc8b017269f22d9779feb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/adb6f016f9c7a01d7a56326ce89456ebffda82341f4d7c04842ae724d99f6a7e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69a5be2342ccb93edabb6cf6b8d672ecea87b412067b9f7b569fc017944199d0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/14e27a003c272837ca30142ea59f761b439cb354de6e8a84345df168c99c1efd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4e749c3a537e12e84fafd7dc2461900136da2bca75ba78ad762c0b99b3149e40.jpg"],"titleId":"0100564024aea000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000073295","name":"Wukong Black Legend: Hero’s Weapon","img":"a73e733ec7805cc8b1d08a84f5c6cc7a99f28ae8ffaa4ada618a7f9462e80d63","date":"2026-05-14","mem":false},{"id":"70050000076491","name":"Wukong Black Legend: Nightfall Descends","img":"ae625db0cf9c03ae91e6e2184a9c0b9e6f9bcd2a66f8efc2d39d168a9d21d3ec","date":"2026-07-16","mem":false},{"id":"70050000077776","name":"Wukong Black Legend: Warrior Skin","img":"9c25366118d61868e59d1788be5c7cff349bc81ad25e4d6d3bf62762b75409e7","date":"2026-08-13","mem":false}]}